**依据 1 · 源码核查**：[src/hosts/deepseek-harness/guard.ts:72-104](https://github.com/kenryu42/cc-safety-net/blob/71baf747e2a5246bdf613a2894f2d6e7a5ad80bf/src/hosts/deepseek-harness/guard.ts#L72-L104)

